# What: Files Git must not track in this sample: dependencies, build output, archives, local
#     credentials and SQLite files.
# Why: Definition of Done [CAP-S09] - the sample stays safe when copied out as a standalone project.
# If missing or unlinked: node_modules, gen/, .mtar archives or credential files can be committed.
node_modules/
gen/
mta_archives/
*.mtar
default-env.json
.cdsrc-private.json
.env
.env.*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
coverage/
